                        {
                            "text": "A tiny piece of gravel was <w>lodging</w> itself deep inside the sole of his shoe.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "pl": "Drobny kamyk <w>wbijał</w> się głęboko w podeszwę jego buta."
                            }
